{"id":"aufrecht","lemma":"aufrecht","pos":"adj","rank":3760,"glosses":["upright, erect, tall","yet present, not yet brought to fall","unbowed, brave, resolute"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯fˌʁɛçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/87/De-aufrecht.ogg/De-aufrecht.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"aufrechter","superlative":"am aufrechtesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Er saß aufrecht.","en":"He was sitting up straight.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to sit","l":"sitzen"},null]},{"text":"Das Baby kann sich aufrecht halten, aber noch nicht laufen.","en":"The baby can stand but can't walk.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"to hold"},{"g":"but"},null,null,{"g":"to walk"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"not yet"]]},{"text":"Sitz aufrecht.","en":"Sit up straight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69490","words":[{"g":"seat"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe gehört, dass es schlecht für den Rücken sei, aufrecht zu sitzen.","en":"I've heard that sitting up straight is bad for your back.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"bad"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"back"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to sit"}]},{"text":"Tom saß aufrecht.","en":"Tom was sitting up straight.","words":[null,{"g":"to sit","l":"sitzen"},null]}]}